{"articleNo":"48173","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=48173&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[국제] 유학생 TOPIK 중급/고급 준비반(무료강좌) 개설 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.04.18","hit":"4639","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">외국인 유학생들의 입학, 취업, 장학금&nbsp;취득을 위해 반드시&nbsp;필요한</span></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">한국어능력시험 중</span></font><font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><topik>급/고급 준비반 수업<font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(무료강좌)</span></font>을 아래와 같</topik></span></font><font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">이</span></font><font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;특별 개설하오</span></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">니, 많은 유학생들이 이번 강좌를 통해 </span></font><font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">한국어능력시험 공인성적을 </span></font><font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">취득할 수 </span></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><font color=\"#0055ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">있기를 바랍니다.</span></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">1</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">.</font> <font color=\"#ff007f\">일정 : 2012. 4. 23(월) ~ 7. 13(금) [12주, 36시간]</font></span></font></strong></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">2. 과정 : 중급(3급~4급) 준비반, 고급(5급~6급) 준비반</font></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">3. 대상 : 외국인 유학생(한국어연수과정, 학부과정, 교환학생, 대학원생) </font></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">4. 수업시간 </font></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">&nbsp; 1) 중급(3급~4급) 준비반 : 화, 목 16:00 ~ 17:30 </font></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">&nbsp; 2) 고급(5급~6급) 준비반 : 화 14:00~ 15:30, 목 18:30 ~ 20:00</font></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">5&nbsp;수강 인원 :&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#ff007f\">선착순 20명(한 수업)&nbsp;</font></span></strong></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">6. 강사 : 허미숙</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">7. 비용 : 무료</font></span></strong></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">8. 접수처 : 이오스관 112호 국제교류교육원 행정실</font></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">9. 접수기한 : 2012년 4월 23일(월) </font></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">주변 유학생들에게 널리 홍보해 주시기 바랍니다. </font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">국제교류교육원장</font></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
